keymasq (0.4.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Rebase the packaged desktop application identity on keymasq.tools and
    move the GTK app ID, desktop ID, AppStream ID, and icon namespace to
    tools.keymasq.keymasq.
  * Restore the About dialog icon on installed packages by making the GUI
    use the packaged icon name.
  * Add packaging smoke checks that verify the launcher icon name matches
    the GUI application identity.

 -- nyrda <nyrda@keymasq.tools>  Thu, 16 Apr 2026 10:07:57 +0000

keymasq (0.3-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add first-class Niri compositor support, including direct action dispatch.
  * Expand superkeys into pattern and overload modes with stricter validation.
  * Make superkey bindings value-aware so wheel directions and similar inputs map cleanly.
  * Split stable tagged releases from manual prerelease packaging.

 -- nyrda <nyrda@keymasq.tools>  Fri, 10 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000

